    <md:title>1.1.2: Self Check</md:title>
    <md:uuid>edac7f3f-59b6-4da8-bff3-1cae6ca75747</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section>
    <para dir="ltr">A ninth-grade class is ordering pizza for lunch. There are \( n \) students in the class. Each slice of pizza costs $3 and the delivery fee is $8. Which expression represents the total cost if each student gets 2 slices of pizza? </para>
  </section>
</content>
</document>
